{"id":"b82abcee4938fc49","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-isomorphism.md","title":"Structure Isomorphism","display":"df-isomorphism — Structure Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-isomorphism","aliases":["57-df-isomorphism"],"display":"df-isomorphism — Structure Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","[[57-df-relation-domain]]","[[57-df-range]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-isomorphism — Structure Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c8928e339d0b9e54\" href=\"?note=c8928e339d0b9e54\" title=\"57-df-partial-isomorphism\">57-df-partial-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e4912637cb244efd\" href=\"?note=e4912637cb244efd\" title=\"57-df-relation-domain\">57-df-relation-domain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" href=\"?note=a23da7b2fd81c2fb\" title=\"57-df-range\">57-df-range</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(B=|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 为候选集合映射，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartIso}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartIso}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{dom}\">\\(\\mathrm{dom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ran}\">\\(\\mathrm{ran}\\)</span> 取列出的依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\">\\(p:\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 表示指定同构映射的记号。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Iso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{dom}(p)=A\\land\\mathrm{ran}(p)=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Iso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{dom}(p)=A\\land\\mathrm{ran}(p)=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Iso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p:\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Iso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{Iso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{Iso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同构对象保持为全定义且满射的部分同构；单射性来自 PartIso 的显式单射条件，不来自函数符号条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-partial-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c8928e339d0b9e54","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-partial-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-relation-domain","status":"resolved","id":"e4912637cb244efd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-relation-domain]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-range","status":"resolved","id":"a23da7b2fd81c2fb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-range]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"A=|\\mathfrak A|","display":false},{"tex":"B=|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartIso}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ran}","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Iso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{PartIso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\land\\mathrm{dom}(p)=A\\land\\mathrm{ran}(p)=B.","display":true},{"tex":"p:\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Iso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B\\leftrightarrow\\exists p\\;\\mathrm{Iso}(p,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B).","display":true}],"bytes":1113,"backlinks":[{"id":"35b5424a3b2d0629","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定字母表 $S$、非空值域集合 $C$。$Q$ 为以全部 $S$-结构为定义域、以 $C$ 为值域的候选类函数；$Q^{\\mathfrak A}$ 表示 $Q(\\mathfrak A)$。类函数及类量词在背景类理论中使用，或在固定宇宙内作相对解释。$\\cong$ 见 [[57-df-isomorphism]]。本文件原“广义量词”只要求同构不变，不附加单调性、二值性或特定元数类型。"},{"id":"80bd19d81f860e01","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S_<$ 为纯关系字母表：唯一非逻辑符号为二元 $<$，没有常量及函数。$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_{S_<}$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$B=|\\mathfrak B|$；两结构的 $<$ 解释均满足 [[57-df-total-order]] 的严格全序条件。$\\mathrm{DLO}$ 和 $\\mathrm{NoEnd}$ 取 [[57-df-dlo]]。$|A|=|B|=\\aleph_0$；$\\cong$ 取 [[57-df-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"b430b63369811858","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$\\pi:\\mathfrak A\\cong\\mathfrak B$ 取 [[57-df-isomorphism]]；$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$。"},{"id":"bbf3699dee0bf4ca","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$\\equiv$ 为初等等价；$\\mathrm{UltraFilt}(I)$ 取 [[57-df-ultrafilter]]，超幂及同构取 [[57-df-ultrapower]]、[[57-df-isomorphism]]。量词 $I$ 遍历非空集合，背景集合论为 ZFC。"},{"id":"3f589aad5d527efc","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecf842768c6ea96e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S$ 为可数字母表，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$ 且 $\\bigl||\\mathfrak A|\\bigr|\\le\\aleph_0$。$\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\omega_1\\omega}(S)$ 与 $\\models_\\infty$ 取 [[57-df-Lomega1omega]]；$\\cong$ 见 [[57-df-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"5279ef5333525808","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4ca21511bbcedbcd","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"077255ba47a9a93e","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"672b43fc6a891c3a","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-isomorphism]]"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-